en tub. The second bedroom offers direct access to the screened balcony, creating a comfortable indoor-outdoor living space for family or guests while providing a secure, enclosed area to enjoy the Florida weather. The fully equipped kitchen features ample cabinetry, generous counter space, and plenty of storage, making meal preparation both convenient and enjoyable. Residents of the gated Sun Lake community enjoy outstanding amenities, including: Resort-style heated swimming pool and hot tub, Clubhouse, fully equipped fitness center, Tennis court, beautifully maintained grounds with a private gated entrance. Enjoy the convenience of being within walking distance of both casual and fine dining, shopping, and everyday conveniences. The location also offers quick access to major highways, making commuting throughout Central Florida easy. Disney employees will especially appreciate the short drive to the parks and surrounding resorts. This well-maintained condo offers the perfect combination of comfort, convenience, and an unbeatable location. Schedule your private showing today!","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":1800,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/a0c755bfb93d57ba40b773b98c198e25l-m1729354558r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["road","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/a0c755bfb93d57ba40b773b98c198e25l-m1729354558s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/a0c755bfb93d57ba40b773b98c198e25l-m1729354558r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/a0c755bfb93d57ba40b773b98c198e25l-m4200434704r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["condo","road","exterior"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/a0c755bfb93d57ba40b773b98c198e25l-m4200434704s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/a0c755bfb93d57ba40b773b98c198e25l-m4200434704r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url